{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be real numbers greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for which there exists a positive real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/421dbe5ac249bea2c9d25145a7eb9b73644c5c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> different from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3cf084efbe6ea20e4571491e473bcc3aa15c877.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(\\log_a{c} + \\log_b{c}) = 9\\log_{ab}{c}.\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Find the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c9f9c8e8f4c98be96e78eea74d69491b83accf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"49\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/748229dd679c3f54bb2ab0a1d63280037e099c86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\sqrt{2} \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\sqrt{3} \\qquad \\text{(C) }2 \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\sqrt{6} \\qquad \\text{(E) }3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We may rewrite the given equation as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/1/dc180b3b66d8f16f7f57c6f76757345768045d38.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\left(\\frac {\\log c}{\\log a} + \\frac {\\log c}{\\log b} \\right) = \\frac {9\\log c}{\\log a + \\log b}\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/3586f3681181696bbd55d6ffabaaea93e34de5e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfc32182d344c29a2d18146465f29aa52f3f040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, so we may divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc36bc3977819348151a5391404636c644240c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> on both sides. After making the substitutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50c5ebecd4af4e1f8a20e1ff440e67284befa1ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\log a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9868695f9bf2f8a5700e3fc69d1e692313d06a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, our equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84b7e9daac34552d84eeb2e3a391d4ba9b35a00.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {2}{x} + \\frac {2}{y} = \\frac {9}{x+y}\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Rewriting the left-hand side gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1779e615a828581c035db9233bcbaadb58c954d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {2(x+y)}{xy} = \\frac {9}{x+y}\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Cross-multiplying gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44cb826a052eecdab06d037f3867115e1e2a18ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x+y)^2 = 9xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2eac863e98398cc2843c64f77363c8f31d9abd89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x^2 - 5xy + 2y^2 = 0\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Factoring gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e1474de0e52d9c454e39b03d33afec800e26220b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x-y)(x-2y) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aac53c410ed52e7f92c78eb2b278eeaabea8eb18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x}{y} = 2, \\frac {1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"71\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p><p>Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/608adc61dd6e73b8b6a2dcefb3167e4fb0cf0821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x}{y} = \\frac {\\log a}{\\log b} = \\log_{a} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"147\" height=\"43\" />. Therefore, the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c536e4081fbd6547a3782af277c5a1e55a1f7637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff5f6f654e5f6985e1cfe6afcd4e0c9cbd52817.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\text{(C) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017075703\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 209/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4377/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report